    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p>The link to access the public roadmap is on our Discord.</p><br><h1>Discord</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/46e4c64ed701d295fe3a82395830df9f.avif?t=1740735066\" width=616 height=207 /></span></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p>v0.1 :<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1 simple level.<br></li><li> Hidden pieces to unlock by assembling others.<br></li><li> Trap that repels your puzzle pieces.<br></li><li> 8 extra artworks.</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>SVG-001 PUZZLE was the very first <strong><u>S</u></strong>hort <strong><u>V</u></strong>ideo <strong><u>G</u></strong>ame in my SVG series.<br><br>It's a very classic jigsaw puzzle game with stunning visuals and beautifully crafted environments and characters.<br><br>I started this project for my little girl which love doing puzzle.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/ac01658b46e19785e3dfd0df31bc39ed.poster.avif?t=1740735066\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/ac01658b46e19785e3dfd0df31bc39ed.webm?t=1740735066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/ac01658b46e19785e3dfd0df31bc39ed.mp4?t=1740735066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>With &quot;Puzzle&quot; as keyword, everything is about puzzle, the main character is a puzzle piece which dive into a mesmerizing journey where every piece matters, and every solution unlocks a new mystery.</i> (WIP)<br><br><i>More levels will be added later.</i> (WIP)",
    "about_the_game": "SVG-001 PUZZLE was the very first <strong><u>S</u></strong>hort <strong><u>V</u></strong>ideo <strong><u>G</u></strong>ame in my SVG series.<br><br>It's a very classic jigsaw puzzle game with stunning visuals and beautifully crafted environments and characters.<br><br>I started this project for my little girl which love doing puzzle.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/ac01658b46e19785e3dfd0df31bc39ed.poster.avif?t=1740735066\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/ac01658b46e19785e3dfd0df31bc39ed.webm?t=1740735066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941550/extras/ac01658b46e19785e3dfd0df31bc39ed.mp4?t=1740735066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>With &quot;Puzzle&quot; as keyword, everything is about puzzle, the main character is a puzzle piece which dive into a mesmerizing journey where every piece matters, and every solution unlocks a new mystery.</i> (WIP)<br><br><i>More levels will be added later.</i> (WIP)",
